% Tónica 06_mi: Mi — 7 Modos Paralelos bajo el esquema E.J. 4
% E.J. 4 — Escalas Diatónicas Modales por Terceras (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))

X:1
T:Modo 1: Mi Jónico (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 1/7 (Mayor) | Escala mayor base | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - 7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:E
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(EFGABcde) (fedcBAGF) | (GABcdefg) (agfedcBA) |
(Bcdefgab) (c'bagfedc) | (defgabc'd') (e'd'c'bagfe) |
(defgabc'd') (c'bagfedc) | (Bcdefgab) (agfedcBA) |
(GABcdefg) (fedcBAGF) | (EFGABcde) (dcBAGF E2) |]

X:2
T:Modo 2: Mi Lidio (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 2/7 (Mayor) | Cuarta aumentada accidental: La♯ | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - ♯4 - 5 - 6 - 7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:E
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(EFG^ABcde) (fedcBAGF) | (G^ABcdefg) (^agfedcBA) |
(Bcdefg^ab) (c'bagfedc) | (defg^abc'd') (e'd'c'bagfe) |
(defg^abc'd') (c'bagfedc) | (Bcdefg^ab) (agfedcB^A) |
(G^ABcdefg) (fedcBAGF) | (EFG^ABcde) (dcBAGF E2) |]

X:3
T:Modo 3: Mi Mixolidio (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 3/7 (Mayor) | Séptima menor accidental: Re♮ | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - ♭7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:E
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(EFGABc=de) (fedcBAGF) | (GABc=defg) (agfedcBA) |
(Bc=defgab) (c'bagfedc) | (=defgabc'=d') (e'd'c'bagfe) |
(=defgabc'=d') (c'bagfedc) | (Bc=defgab) (agfedcBA) |
(GABc=defg) (fedcBAGF) | (EFGABc=de) (dcBAGF E2) |]

X:4
T:Modo 4: Mi Dórico (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 4/7 (Menor) | Sexta mayor accidental: Do♯ | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - ♭3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - ♭7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:Em
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(EFGAB^cde) (fedcBAGF) | (GAB^cdefg) (agfedcBA) |
(B^cdefgab) (^c'bagfedc) | (defgab^c'd') (e'd'c'bagfe) |
(defgab^c'd') (c'bagfed^c) | (B^cdefgab) (agfedcBA) |
(GAB^cdefg) (fedcBAGF) | (EFGAB^cde) (dcBAGF E2) |]

X:5
